[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3672754920","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114131#issuecomment-3672754920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114131","id":3672754920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7a6cro","user":{"login":"gilzoide","id":4603360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDMzNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4603360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide","html_url":"https://github.com/gilzoide","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T23:41:53Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T23:41:53Z","body":"Took a look at the check that failed, the error is a connection timeout while trying to access https://codeload.github.com/godotengine/regression-test-project/zip/refs/heads/4.0 (20 times, failed all of the retries). Maybe it's a transient error and it will work if run again, the URL seems to work when I open it in my web browser.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3672754920/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832615393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114131#issuecomment-3832615393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114131","id":3832615393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kcRHh","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T02:42:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T02:43:17Z","body":"We just stumbled onto this today.\r\n\r\nWhen the `extensions_list.cfg` file does not exist or the extension isn't listed in the config file, the GDExtension is loaded after the editor completes the full startup. This is when the extension is added in the `.godot/extensions_list.cfg` file. And as the OP points out, this occurs after `ScriptServer::init_languages` has been called, which completely breaks any `ScriptLanguageExtension` implementation that may register itself with the Engine during any of the GDExtension's init levels.\r\n\r\nOn a restart, once the extension is in the config file, the extension is loaded in the right order so that its init levels are all called before `ScriptServer::init_languages` is called in the editor startup sequence.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832615393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3836410522","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114131#issuecomment-3836410522","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114131","id":3836410522,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kqvqa","user":{"login":"gilzoide","id":4603360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDMzNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4603360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide","html_url":"https://github.com/gilzoide","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T16:44:12Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T16:44:12Z","body":"> While this solves the fact that ScriptLanguageExtension::_init is not called, I believe there is also an issue where the ScriptCreateDialog may not yet show the script language in the list, and an editor restart is still mandatory.\r\n> Did you check that @gilzoide ?\r\n\r\n@Naros Not really, but I could take a look at it. Not sure if this should be taken care of in this PR or on a new one.\r\n\r\nThe problem I had specifically was a crash while running automated tests on Lua GDExtension, so I was not opening the editor manually as an end user would and didn't catch the problem you describe.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3836410522/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3836473464","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114131#issuecomment-3836473464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114131","id":3836473464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kq_B4","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T16:55:28Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T16:56:36Z","body":"@gilzoide I'll take a closer look at the PR, and if we can add it here, I think it would be good to close all gaps around this rather than trying to address this piecemeal.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3836473464/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837532557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114131#issuecomment-3837532557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114131","id":3837532557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kvBmN","user":{"login":"gilzoide","id":4603360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDMzNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4603360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide","html_url":"https://github.com/gilzoide","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gilzoide/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T21:43:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T21:45:16Z","body":"Hey @Naros, I took a look into `ScriptCreateDialog` here and it seems it [fills the list of available script languages in its constructor](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/script/script_create_dialog.cpp#L893-L899), never updating it again.\r\n\r\nMaybe there could be a `ScriptCreateDialog::register_script_language` method that we could call in `ScriptServer::register_language` inside a `#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED` block (and the corresponding \"unregister_script_language\" of course). I see accessing the `ScriptCreateDialog` is easily done with `FileSystemDock::get_singleton()->get_script_create_dialog()`.\r\nI can add this fix into the PR if you think this solution makes sense. What do you think?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837532557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837770183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114131#issuecomment-3837770183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114131","id":3837770183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kv7nH","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T23:18:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T23:18:42Z","body":"I think it makes sense @gilzoide but I would ilke to hear from the core/editor team on their thoughts.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues